{"id":"16613851c4bce386","group":"92","path":"92/92-ax-modus-ponens.md","title":"Modus Ponens Rule","display":"ax-modus-ponens — Modus Ponens Rule","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-ax-modus-ponens","aliases":["92-ax-modus-ponens"],"display":"ax-modus-ponens — Modus Ponens Rule","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-inference-rule]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-ax-modus-ponens"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-ax-modus-ponens</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-modus-ponens — Modus Ponens Rule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" href=\"?note=5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" title=\"92-df-inference-rule\">92-df-inference-rule</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\)</span> (space of rule instances, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" href=\"?note=5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" title=\"92-df-inference-rule\">92-df-inference-rule</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP}\">\\(\\mathrm{MP}\\)</span> (definition-target rule set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}modus\\text{-}ponens} \\vdash \\mathrm{MP}\\coloneqq\\{(\\langle\\varphi,\\varphi\\to\\psi\\rangle,\\psi)\\in\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}modus\\text{-}ponens} \\vdash \\mathrm{MP}\\coloneqq\\{(\\langle\\varphi,\\varphi\\to\\psi\\rangle,\\psi)\\in\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP}\">\\(\\mathrm{MP}\\)</span> : Modus Ponens推理规则</li>\n<li>从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\to \\psi\">\\(\\varphi \\to \\psi\\)</span>推出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span></li>\n<li>这是命题逻辑的核心推理规则</li>\n<li>系统G的基本推理规则之一</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-inference-rule","status":"resolved","id":"5efcbe99d24a5bd9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-inference-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formulas, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-inference-rule","status":"resolved","id":"5efcbe99d24a5bd9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location